WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.704
Email Settings sets when the weekly and “your books are in” emails go out.

2
00:00:06.704 --> 00:00:11.993
Send is where you check an email before customers get it.

3
00:00:11.993 --> 00:00:22.080
Preview shows the email as a customer will see it.

4
00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:28.205
Send a test to me emails it to you. Never use Send to everyone to test.

5
00:00:28.205 --> 00:00:32.523
Email Log lists what was sent and when.
